      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is more than niche, this would be great to have in a lot of different situations.\n\nThere is a similar post here which I also hope gets attention\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-an-sdk-component-that-disallows-portals-being-placed-in-certain-areas",
      "viewerReactions": null,
